== Trivia ==
* This is the only transformation that does not affect Isaac himself, but instead transforms (and even fuses) certain [[familiar]]s.
* This is the only transformation that has a unique animation.
* {{Dlc|r}} This is the only transformation that {{c|Tainted Isaac|n}} is required to have 3 pieces of in his inventory in order to obtain it.

